WEBVTT

00:00:00.425 --> 00:00:07.951
In this video, you will sponsor your installer company, so it stands out at the top of the map list, in the installer list, or both.

00:00:07.951 --> 00:00:11.579
We go as far as the secure payment page, and stop there.

00:00:11.579 --> 00:00:12.678
We start on the map.

00:00:13.523 --> 00:00:15.197
Start at SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:18.135 --> 00:00:20.685
On the home page, tap Use my location.

00:00:22.361 --> 00:00:23.341
Then tap Allow.

00:00:27.012 --> 00:00:30.460
Look at the top right corner of the map, and tap the three dots.

00:00:32.163 --> 00:00:34.227
In the menu, tap Promote your event.

00:00:36.028 --> 00:00:38.688
This page is for paid placements.

00:00:38.688 --> 00:00:40.603
At the top, tap See all pricing.

00:00:42.506 --> 00:00:44.931
The Pricing page is split by who you are.

00:00:44.931 --> 00:00:46.099
Tap Installers.

00:00:47.658 --> 00:00:50.504
Your company profile is free, and it comes first.

00:00:51.372 --> 00:00:54.606
Below the free profile are three paid placements.

00:00:54.606 --> 00:00:57.532
Paid placements are always labelled Sponsor.

00:00:57.532 --> 00:01:01.041
The Banner is a pill in the strip at the top of the map list.

00:01:01.041 --> 00:01:04.799
Top of the list puts your company first in the installer list.

00:01:04.799 --> 00:01:06.359
The third card takes both.

00:01:07.206 --> 00:01:09.088
Each card folds open.

00:01:09.088 --> 00:01:12.154
Tap What's included, to see everything the Banner gives you.

00:01:13.964 --> 00:01:15.559
Under Banner, tap Choose.

00:01:17.496 --> 00:01:21.027
You sign in with your company email, and we already are.

00:01:21.027 --> 00:01:22.423
Then pick your company.

00:01:22.423 --> 00:01:24.230
It needs a free profile first.

00:01:25.083 --> 00:01:29.452
These are the three plans: Banner, Top of the list, and both together.

00:01:29.452 --> 00:01:32.900
Your choice is marked, and each one lists everything it includes.

00:01:34.520 --> 00:01:37.338
Below is a summary with the exact dates.

00:01:37.338 --> 00:01:40.967
It starts today, and ends on the last day of the season.

00:01:40.967 --> 00:01:43.177
Automatic renewal is optional.

00:01:43.177 --> 00:01:47.030
It is off unless you tick this box, and you can cancel it any time.

00:01:47.886 --> 00:01:49.610
Then tap Continue to payment.

00:01:51.687 --> 00:01:54.062
This opens Stripe's secure page.

00:01:54.062 --> 00:01:59.947
We stop here, because this is only a demonstration, and we never enter card details in a video.

00:02:00.809 --> 00:02:06.133
After you pay, your placement turns on within a few minutes, and a receipt arrives by email.

00:02:07.002 --> 00:02:09.976
That is how you sponsor your installer company.

00:02:09.976 --> 00:02:14.452
Every paid placement is labelled Sponsor, and renewal is always your choice.

00:02:15.814 --> 00:02:17.831
Next up: Add an event to the map.
